    "summary": "This enhancement requires **GENESTEALER CULTS INFANTRY** on the bearer. A friendly unit picked to shoot can get this benefit once each turn if it is no farther than 9″ from the bearer. It must be **ASTRA MILITARUM MOUNTED** or **ASTRA MILITARUM INFANTRY**. You may improve its models’ ranged weapon [Armour Penetration](vsdata:core-rule/profiles) by 1 through phase end.",
